<title>JAPAN: MOF SAYS PLANS TO HOLD T-BILL AUCTION ON FRIDAY.</title>
<headline>MOF SAYS PLANS TO HOLD T-BILL AUCTION ON FRIDAY.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Finance Ministry is planning to offer Treasury Bills (T-bills) through a price-competitive auction on Friday, a ministry official said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Traders said the offer was likely to be for the purpose of rolling over 1.5 trillion yen worth of 173rd three-month T-bills due to mature on August 20.</p>
<p>-- Tokyo Treasury Desk +81-3-5473-3748</p>
